Darden's net cash from operating activities from continuing operations for fiscal Q3 2025 was about **$588.2 million**. The warehouse has no standalone Q3 figure for this period, so I derived it: the nine-month YTD value ($1,250.0M, through Feb 23, 2025) minus the six-month YTD value ($661.8M, through Nov 24, 2024).

Caveat: some filing metadata looks unreliable. The filing dates run into 2026, and the same accession numbers appear against different periods (for example, one accession covers both the FY2025 and FY2026 nine-month figures). The derived number is internally consistent, but the source records should be checked before relying on it.

